18:T90c,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"/work/florence/","url":"/work/florence/","name":"Florence - KOTA","isPartOf":{"@id":"/#website"},"primaryImageOfPage":{"@id":"/work/florence/#primaryimage"},"image":{"@id":"/work/florence/#primaryimage"},"thumbnailUrl":"/app/uploads/2024/05/hero.png","datePublished":"2024-06-25T09:45:54+00:00","dateModified":"2025-04-10T12:30:41+00:00","description":"Florence is reshaping healthcare staffing. We helped them build a brand and digital experience that reflects their vision. Here’s how.","breadcrumb":{"@id":"/work/florence/#breadcrumb"},"inLanguage":"en-US","potentialAction":[{"@type":"ReadAction","target":["/work/florence/"]}]},{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"/work/florence/#primaryimage","url":"/app/uploads/2024/05/hero.png","contentUrl":"/app/uploads/2024/05/hero.png","width":2448,"height":1378},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","@id":"/work/florence/#breadcrumb","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Florence"}]},{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"/#website","url":"/","name":"KOTA","description":"","publisher":{"@id":"/#organization"},"potentialAction":[{"@type":"SearchAction","target":{"@type":"EntryPoint","urlTemplate":"/?s={search_term_string}"},"query-input":{"@type":"PropertyValueSpecification","valueRequired":true,"valueName":"search_term_string"}}],"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Organization","@id":"/#organization","name":"KOTA","alternateName":"KOTA creative","url":"/","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"/#/schema/logo/image/","url":"/app/uploads/2024/11/Logo-Profile.png","contentUrl":"/app/uploads/2024/11/Logo-Profile.png","width":1080,"height":1080,"caption":"KOTA"},"image":{"@id":"/#/schema/logo/image/"},"sameAs":["https://www.facebook.com/kotacreative/","https://x.com/kotacreative"]}]}20:T47a,<h3><span class="notion-enable-hover" data-token-index="0">Visual branding and positioning</span><!-- notionvc: 3bf994cc-c0ac-4d55-a47c-cec3444748dc --></h3>
<p>We started with a deep dive into Florence&#8217;s world. Through stakeholder and customer interviews, market research, and competitor analysis, we gathered invaluable insights. And armed with this knowledge, we then held a brand positioning workshop.</p>
<p>Ideas flew, creativity sparked, and out of it emerged a compelling brand manifesto, mission, and vision that captured Florence’s spirit. We elevated Florence’s brand positioning by creating a cohesive and compelling digital identity aligned with their mission and values. Then, we integrated these brand elements consistently across the website, including colour schemes, typography, imagery, and tone of voice.</p>
<p>The tone of voice we crafted is confident, clear, and human—ensuring every communication felt consistent and engaging. By highlighting their core strengths and unique value propositions, we crafted a digital presence that resonates with their target audience and strengthens their market position.</p>
