UI teams mapped out user journeys, crafted detailed wireframes, and built interactive prototypes. The goal was clear: create a site that’s as stunning as it is functional.</p>\n<p>We introduced a clean, modern aesthetic with a calming colour palette, inviting users into a welcoming digital space. New graphic shapes and hand-drawn elements added a unique, approachable touch.</p>\n<p>The result? An intuitive navigation system that lets healthcare professionals and organisations effortlessly find what they need. And with responsive design principles in place, the site looked and functioned beautifully on any device.</p>\n"}}]}]}],null]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"$undefined","data-margin":"small","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"SingleImage_containedImage__N2jLD","children":["$","$L1f",null,{"data":{"__typename":"Project_Singleproject_ContentBuilder_SingleVideo","fieldGroupName":"Project_Singleproject_ContentBuilder_SingleVideo","alignment":"contained","marginBottom":"small","loop":{"mediaItemUrl":"/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2024/05/Florence-11-1.mp4"},"fullVideo":null}}]}]}],false]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"SingleImage_singleImage__NY3zv","data-margin":"small","children":["$","$L23",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"SingleImage_containedImage__N2jLD","children":["$","$L1e",null,{"image":{"altText":"","srcSet":"/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2024/06/florence5-1400x788.jpg 1400w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2024/06/florence5-500x281.jpg 500w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2024/06/florence5-768x432.jpg 768w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2024/06/florence5-1536x864.jpg 1536w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2024/06/florence5.jpg 1920w","sourceUrl":"/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2024/06/florence5